 abstract = {Integrated technologies in the Internet of Things (IoT) portfolio enable smart usage of data. It pulls the world into new era of fast and interactive automation in computing paradigm and will drive the future of smart world. In spite of many technologies, the integration of cloud computing becomes enabler for IoT and acts as a communication facilitator. The cloud IoT; a novel paradigm merged together expected as a seamless platform for a large number of application scenarios. It also enabled leading&#x2010;edge device connectivity to offer an extremely scalable and cost effective IoT Infrastructure with differentiated and value&#x2010;added services. This chapter explores the understanding of cloud IoT integration, recent advancements in cloud IoT integration scenario, shed light on their concerning issues and analysis of application areas of advanced cloud IoT paradigm; which paves the way for next level of the digitally smart world.},
